      "html": "<button class=\"ds-platform\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-platform-icon\">文</span><strong>公众号</strong><small>深入讲述</small></button>",
      "css": ".ds-platform{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #4a7c70;border-radius:7px;background:#ecf3eb;color:var(--ink,#1e3538);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #83a58b1a;font:13px Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-platform-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef6ea;color:#659553;font-size:11px}.ds-platform strong{font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.ds-platform small{font-size:11px;color:#9ba493}.ds-platform:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9fc8b6;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "横向功能导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "feature-card",
      "description": "原生按钮组成的横向卡片组；中文功能名，不再生成英文眉题。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-feature-deck\" aria-label=\"工作台功能\"><button class=\"ds-feature-card\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9Z M14 3v6h6 M8 13h8 M8 17h5\"/></svg><strong>创作任务</strong><small>选定人群、场景与平台，写下这次创作的起点。</small><span class=\"ds-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"ds-feature-card\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>内容策略</strong><small>围绕真实需求，找到产品与读者之间的切入点。</small></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-feature-deck{display:flex;gap:16px;max-width:100%;padding:13px 8px 9px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x proximity;font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-feature-card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:0 0 292px;height:176px;padding:22px 24px 19px;border:0;border-radius:20px;background:var(--cream,#fff2de);color:var(--deck-ink,#203b3b);text-align:left;scroll-snap-align:start;box-shadow:0 7px 20px rgba(5,47,55,.10);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}.ds-feature-card>svg{position:absolute;right:22px;top:21px;width:38px;height:38px;stroke:var(--deck-blue,#2689a5);stroke-width:1.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-feature-card strong{display:block;margin-top:auto;margin-bottom:7px;font-size:21px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.25}.ds-feature-card small{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;max-width:235px;color:#4f635a}.ds-feature-card:hover{background:#fffaee;transform:translateY(-3px)}.ds-feature-card[aria-pressed=true]{background:#fff9ed;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #256b70,0 7px 20px rgba(5,47,55,.10)}.ds-current{position:absolute;right:19px;bottom:16px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#256b70}.ds-feature-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-feature-card{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "居中工作面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "feature-panel",
      "description": "不透明工作纸面及固定标题栏；预览展示其形状，应用中固定在视口正中心。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-panel-title\"><header class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"ds-panel-title\">创作任务</h2><p>设置产品、人群与平台，开始一份图文任务。</p></div><button class=\"ds-close\" aria-label=\"收起功能面板\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></button></header><div class=\"ds-panel-body\">工作内容在独立滚动区呈现。</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{width:min(650px,100%);overflow:hidden;border-radius:17px;background:#fff9ef;box-shadow:0 22px 70px rgba(6,36,39,.3);color:var(--ink,#1e3538);font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:17px 24px;background:#fff8ed;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e4d9}.ds-panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}.ds-panel-heading p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#60776a}.ds-close{display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:7px;border:1px solid #d4ddd2;border-radius:6px;background:#fffefa;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9fc8b6;outline-offset:3px}.ds-panel-body{padding:22px 28px 28px;background:var(--paper,#fffefa);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}"
    },
    {
      "name": "官网产品展示结构",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "product-hero",
      "description": "展示原文、主图和缩略图的结构预览；此示意不包含真实产品图或虚构官网文案，真实图片由同源内存接口返回。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-product\"><h3>对应完整型号</h3><figure class=\"ds-product-hero\"><div class=\"ds-product-view\">官网产品主视觉区域</div><figcaption>华为官网产品图片 · 读取时间</figcaption></figure><div class=\"ds-product-thumbs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"选择产品展示图片\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看官网产品图片 1\" aria-pressed=\"true\">1</button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看官网产品图片 2\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2</button></div><details class=\"ds-original\"><summary>官网原文 · 保留说明与限制条件</summary><p>真实运行时按官网原文展示。</p></details></section>",
      "css": ".ds-product{font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#1e3538);width:100%;max-width:650px}.ds-product h3{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:21px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}.ds-product-hero{margin:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;background:#f4f5f2}.ds-product-view{display:grid;place-items:center;height:210px;color:#4e6659;font-size:13px}.ds-product-hero figcaption{padding:10px 15px;color:#4e6659;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.ds-product-thumbs{display:flex;gap:9px;overflow:auto;padding:12px 0}.ds-product-thumbs button{flex:0 0 72px;height:56px;border:1px solid #c9d6ca;border-radius:5px;background:#f5f7f1;padding:4px;color:#456052;cursor:pointer}.ds-product-thumbs button[aria-pressed=true]{outline:2px solid #326d66;outline-offset:-2px}.ds-product-thumbs button:focus-visible,.ds-original summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #235b56;outline-offset:3px}.ds-original{padding:12px 0;color:#456052;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.ds-original summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:32px}.ds-original p{margin:8px 0}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "穿过石桥，进入创作",
    "overview": "用户选定的 Mostar 天空、远城、石桥和河岸照片构成完整场景。封面以奶油白宋体“越过想象”邀请进入，工作台延续清晰可见的景观。暖奶油功能卡片沿顶部横向排列；选择功能后，卡片整体退后缩小淡化，当前工作面板来到屏幕正中心。\n\n工作面板使用不透明暖白纸面承载表单、产品原文、图片与稿件。景观负责氛围，面板负责阅读和操作；官网产品摄影在产品区有明确份量，原文和条件可展开核对。此文档从现有原生 HTML/CSS/JavaScript 提取，记录用户已批准的界面变化；项目没有 PRODUCT.md，不补造产品设定。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "完整 Mostar 景观持续可见，最终暖白遮罩仅为 7%。",
      "七张横向功能卡片与可关闭、可用 Esc 收起的正中工作面板。",
      "中文宋体封面和官网引文，配合系统无衬线表单与导航。",
      "对应型号的官网原文、可切换产品图和本地 v7 指导明确标注来源。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Photograph Rule",
        "body": "保留用户选定的真实 Mostar 照片层次；场景资源不可用时如实提示，不以抽象渐变或虚构景观冒充。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Clear Surface Rule",
        "body": "景观保持可见，正文与操作放在不透明纸面上；不要通过提高整屏白遮罩来解决局部可读性。",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Rule",
        "body": "官网介绍保留原文及限制条件；图片来自当前明确型号，v7 只指导表达，演示和未验收的生成能力必须标明。",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保留完整 Mostar 景观、中文宋体封面和可跳过、可返回的入口。",
      "Do 使用顶部横向功能卡片；打开功能时让面板居中，关闭或 Esc 后恢复卡片并归还焦点。",
      "Do 保留官网原文、脚注与条件、型号和来源时间；主图使用 contain，缩略图可切换，失败后能选择其他图恢复。",
      "Do 按平台、型号角色与场景展示实际读取的 v7 指导标题，保持事实来源与写作指导分开。",
      "Do 同步检查桌面和窄屏、键盘操作、减少动态效果与长内容滚动，再更新设计令牌。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把隐藏的旧侧栏、旧双栏网格或 86% 背景遮罩写成当前工作台布局。",
      "Don't 把原生组件组织原则说成已安装 shadcn 或已迁移到 React；不把 Apple 参考集合说成官方品牌规范。",
      "Don't 把官网资料或本地 v7 指导说成 ima 实时检索，也不把演示排版说成真实模型广告。",
      "Don't 宣称外链景观可离线完整运行、本机宋体已随项目分发，或内存图片引用永久有效。",
      "Don't 用同名近似型号、其他型号配图、被改写的产品介绍或遗漏限制条件替代本次官网证据。"
    ]
  }
}
